{
  "name": "Cloudmere",
  "category": "Landing pages",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "A website for a small mountain hotel on a lake, with rooms, a booking calendar, spa, dining and an area map",
  "about": "A ten-view website for a boutique hotel on a mountain lake, in snow white, misty blue-grey and pine green, with a night-lake dark theme. The hero sits under drifting cloud, room photos move slowly as you scroll, and the booking calendar paints your stay across two months like a ribbon. Guests can book a room, a treatment, a table or a guided day, find their way on a drawn area map, read and write stories, and keep everything in My stay.",
  "how": [
    "Pick dates in the home booking bar or on Book: tap an arrival day, then the last morning, and watch the ribbon paint the stay",
    "Filter rooms by view, beds, guests and price, flip through each room's photos, save favourites and compare them in the table",
    "Open a room for its gallery, drawn floor plan and live price, then reserve it and go through room, extras and your details",
    "Book a spa treatment or a dinner table with a day and time, and add guided experiences to your stay",
    "On The area, drag and zoom the map, tap places and pick a trail to draw it with its height profile",
    "Share a story on Stories, then manage bookings, plans, room preferences, the theme and Reset demo data in My stay"
  ],
